{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_02",
  "title": "荣誉之人",
  "storyCode": "IS-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "16b9999846b472218cde5c1867749ba4e1247db96fdc7bbc93d37f899a28dc56",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "这里是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你终于醒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "这里是......家里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "德米特，你怎么在这？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "是拉维妮娅小姐把你送回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "根据医生的诊断，你是因为心力交瘁加上受伤，所以昏倒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "吃苹果吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "就知道你想吃，已经给你削好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "拉维妮娅呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "她把你交给护卫就走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你也知道，她向来是不愿意踏入这间宅邸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "为了你来一趟已经是奇迹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "卡拉奇的死，确实是个不小的麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "而你受伤的消息肯定也传出去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "现在，从其他家族的视角看，贝洛内家一瞬间从稳操胜券变成了内忧外患的状态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "随时都可能有人来咬我们一口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "袭击我的那帮人，有没有留下活口？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "很遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "而且他们的尸体上也没有留下任何线索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我猜也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你觉得会是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "萨卢佐一直没有出手，他们是在等待时机，这对他们来说，显然是一个好机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "罗塞蒂......虽然瓦拉赫跟我一起遇袭，他们似乎也是受害者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "但是哥伦比亚家族从来都不是铁板一块。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "对，他们起内讧的可能性是存在的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "而且，也不是没有别的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "啧，真是挑了个好时机。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "给我倒点水吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你这家伙，躺在床上倒是比平时还会发号施令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......你就一定要端一杯开水给我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "是不是该怪你下达的命令不够准确呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......好吧，你总是用这种方法来表达不满，这次又是什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "对德克萨斯的安排，我没法同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "拉维妮娅是个公正的人，她不会诬陷任何一个清白的人，她有她的考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "不，我是说，她原本应该成为你的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "首领既然把她交给你，就有她不会危害家族的把握。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你应该把她打造成一把利器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "而现在，她却被拉维妮娅关了起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "别告诉我，你看不出她也是为了我们家族考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "我承认，在如今这么危险的情况下，还握着德克萨斯这颗烫手山芋，会让你的处境更加岌岌可危。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "她的姓氏再度在叙拉古的土地上出现......实在是太惹眼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "确实，以拉维妮娅的立场，德克萨斯握在她的手上会更加安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "但我们家族内部的人，他们会怎么想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "他们会觉得，你，贝洛内家的大少爷莱昂图索，已经太沉迷于在桌布上过家家的游戏，你变得软弱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你甚至用不好一把刀，还丢失了它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "贝洛内家已经落入下风，不论想找麻烦的是谁，我们都应该强硬地回击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "莱昂，沃尔西尼的新城区不光是你在的建设部的什么无聊“事业”，它该属于贝洛内家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "所以这才是你的真心话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我也有我的考虑，德米特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "愿闻其详。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "好吧，你是我最好的兄弟，也是我的顾问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "在遇袭的时候我就感觉到有些不对了，在听到卡拉奇死后，我就更加明确了这个想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "你刚才问我觉得是谁下的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "实际上我不觉得是萨卢佐或者罗塞蒂的人干的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "下手的人太了解我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "他知道怎么样才能快速而且精确地打击到贝洛内，同时也能打击到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你的意思是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "接下来几天，我会闭门不出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我需要好好养伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "别人认为我们乱了阵脚，那就让他们继续这么认为。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "直到真正的对手自己露出尾巴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "所以你是故意放任拉维妮娅带走德克萨斯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "至于她想怎么用这张牌，交给她自己决定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "这段时间，肯定会有不少针对我们家族的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "你多注意调查背后都是谁在捣鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "......我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "所以，这个答案，能让你满意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "既然你有明确的想法，那我自然会去执行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "毕竟，你才是这里的老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "这还差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "......别让我失望啊，德米特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "喂，瓦拉赫，是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "莱昂，我听说你受伤不轻，你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "还好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "关于白天发生的事，我们需要聊聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我想......你也有要问我的事，有关那个名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......“德克萨斯”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃尔西尼监狱"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "所以你当时被拖住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "那个拖住你的人是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "一个旧识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "旧识？在这个时候出现的旧识？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "你很适应这种场合，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "在龙门，我偶尔也会接受这样的盘问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "龙门......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "总之，我没有必要这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......每一个犯人都是这么说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "实际上，我相信你并不是凶手，切利尼娜小姐。我实在难以想象做这件事对你有任何好处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "而且，莱昂联系过我，他说，出于某些原因，你是可以信任的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......原来如此，你出现在了那么多名流都在场的地方，那本就是贝洛内家给你准备的舞台。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "不过，在如今这样的情况下，将你放在我这边，才是最好的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "你在保护莱昂图索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "也是在保护你，德克萨斯小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "而且......这样或许能分散些其他家族的注意力，他们会猜测贝洛内家族在被如此打击之后，到底会作何打算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "这种忌惮......或许能让我更好地放开手脚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "你真的是法官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "为什么这么问？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "你看起来非常了解家族是如何运作的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......我确实是一名法官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "在叙拉古，想要做好我的职业，我就必须要比家族成员们更了解，他们是如何生存的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "即使我根本不想了解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "不，你理解错了，我的意思是，身为执法者，对执法对象有所了解是理所当然的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "反而是过去的叙拉古，我从没听说过存在这样的法官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "不要搞错了，切利尼娜·德克萨斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "我并不是因为所谓家族之间的制衡而将你带了过来。外人或许会这么判断我的立场，我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "你刚来到这座城市，你还不明白，卡拉奇部长究竟有多么重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "他是一个非常值得尊重的人。他原本可以将正在建造中的新城市变得更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "不仅仅是工业上的建设，他想让市民们有可能过上另一种生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "而他现在死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "我想要找出凶手，将他绳之以法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "他们自以为可以除掉一个又一个不听从他们命令的傀儡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "但我会让他们知道，他们除掉的不是一个个傀儡，而是一个个活生生的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "所以，卡拉奇的死，和你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "而且你也没有发现凶手是谁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "嗯嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "而我交给你的任务，查探贝洛内把德克萨斯找来究竟想要干什么你也没有头绪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "您果然算无遗策，我亲爱的父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "而你在什么都没有做到的情况下，还没有在我召集会议的时候赶回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "这个季节，路上有点堵车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "拉普兰德，我在七年前把你逐出家门，你不再拥有萨卢佐这个姓氏，你知道这意味着什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "我当然知道，这意味着您在想要除掉我这个不听话的工具时，不会再手软。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "你总是很有自知之明，但你似乎并没有做出与你的自知之明相符合的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "只是给那个可怜的小法官一点警告而已，真的需要我去做吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "......为什么我会想要去警告那个法官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "既然那位大少爷闭门不出，那么，那个放出狠话的小法官自然会被认为是贝洛内的代表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "而以您的性格，必然不会就这么相信贝洛内真的就那么示弱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "那么，用那个法官的安危试探一下贝洛内的深浅不是理所当然的事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "text": "既然你知道该怎么做，我要看到成果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "我当然不会违背您的命令，前提是，您想要的和我一致。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "我最最亲爱的父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "萨尔瓦多雷！我们该怎么办！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我该感谢你把我从血亲的控制中解脱出来吗？我该感谢你为了那些感染者劳工们能吃饱肚子而不惜沾上鲜血吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "你杀死的人是我的父亲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "不，你不需要向我陈述他的罪恶，我比你更清楚。你我身上的这些伤痕，正来源于他的施暴。那些劳工的死，正来源于他的盘剥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "可是，可是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "萨尔瓦多雷，我真心实意地感谢你，你救了我，或许还救了很多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "可是，你身上的血腥味正越来越浓......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我们，我们离开这里吧，萨尔瓦多雷，带我去一个......带我去一个能获得平静的地方，好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "或许已经太晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "萨尔瓦多雷，或许当你来到哥伦比亚的第一天，或许当你第一次打磨自己的那把小刀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "这一切都已经注定发生，不可挽回了，是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我在想，如果我是这位薇薇安，我会原谅萨尔瓦多雷吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "即使能够原谅，这种芥蒂也会伴随着两个人一辈子吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你说得完全正确，小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "两个人最后结合在了一起，当然是一种艺术加工处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "事实上，真正的萨尔瓦多雷，并没有和那位薇薇安女士结合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "而且，薇薇安的父亲虽然确实为富不仁，他却对自己的家人照顾有加，尤其是将薇薇安视作自己的掌上明珠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "并没有那么多纯粹的恶人，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "所以，即使那是自己深爱的人，即使自己的父亲确实作恶多端，这也并不是轻易就能原谅的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "薇薇安女士，最后选择离开萨尔瓦多雷，前往另外一座城市，并在那里邂逅了一个真正爱她的人，开始了新的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是，终她一生，她都没有忘记萨尔瓦多雷这个男人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "所以，某种意义上，这个故事，也算是帮她圆梦吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "你很了解......薇薇安女士吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "我叫卡特琳娜，美丽的演员小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "你是新来的演员吗？我常常会来这里，似乎以前并没有见过你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "是的，我叫空，来自龙门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "龙门？真有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "我听说去龙门发展的演员有不少，像你这样从龙门来的，倒是很少见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "有的时候，逆潮流也有逆潮流的好处嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "这我倒是同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "卡特琳娜小姐，关于这位薇薇安女士，您知道现实中她后来怎么样了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "薇薇安......薇薇安她啊，她一直没有忘记萨尔瓦多雷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "或许是这个原因吧，她的儿子，也走上了和萨尔瓦多雷相似的道路——成了家族的一员，并一步一步成了某个家族的领袖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "而这个家族，在后来与萨尔瓦多雷产生了冲突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "所幸，有薇薇安出面，他们两人并没有变成你死我活的关系，反而最终结成了盟友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "难道说，就是剧本中的罗塞蒂家族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "完全正确，你已经把剧本都读过了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "嗯......出于一些个人的原因，我也想尽可能地了解德克萨斯这个家族的过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "你觉得这个故事，怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我......有一些无法认可的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "哦？比如？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "比如萨尔瓦多雷的孙女......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "空，造型师让你来看看衣服的设计！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "啊，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "抱歉，我先失陪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "去吧，我们还会有再见的机会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "空——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "别着急，我们以后还可以慢慢聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "啊，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "......萨尔瓦多雷的孙女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你又在剧院里浪费时间了，首领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "我说过很多次了，瓦拉赫，这不是浪费时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "为了写一个破剧本，把大部分杂事丢给我，这也是一个家族领袖该做的事？你还给自己起了个叫卡特琳娜的假名？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "text": "你有意见？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "不敢。您毕竟是乔万娜·罗塞蒂，我最敬爱的首领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "我明白你的不满。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "这座城市里，有什么值得我操心的事情吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "以前没有，现在有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "卡拉奇死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "但是，卡拉奇原本就是其他家族们为了互相制衡而推上去的普通人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "他死了，说明贝洛内能力不足，仅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "一个长得很像切利尼娜的人突然出现在了莱昂图索身边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "你说，谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "德克萨斯，切利尼娜·德克萨斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "瓦拉赫，我记得你应该不是个喜欢开玩笑的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "而你应该也知道，我最讨厌开德克萨斯玩笑的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "所以我并没有在开玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "贝洛内不知道用什么办法找来了这个人。那显眼的发色......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "和你那张合照上的人一模一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "她没死......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "她跟在莱昂图索身边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "当年的清算，如果不是某个家族把她保下来，她绝无可能活下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "......如果保下她的是贝洛内，倒也说得通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "看来，得找贝洛内谈一谈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "乔万娜，这显然是他们的陷——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "瓦拉赫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......对不起，首领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "与其说是陷阱，不如说是阳谋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "大度点，瓦拉赫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "如果当年真的是贝洛内保下了切利尼娜，我就算登门拜访向他们道谢又有何妨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "准备一下吧，“谈生意”结束了，我要来造访沃尔西尼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......我知道了，我会去安排的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "唉，看来，新剧本要稍微搁置一段时间了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "首领，你明明知道卡拉奇的死对我们来说是个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你却依然关心着德克萨斯这个姓氏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "这样下去，罗塞蒂是没有未来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
